{"id":"89f06cdb-050e-401e-bfad-c23df4187a80","object":"chat.completion","created":1790548445,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"findings\":[{\"statement\":\"Nigeria Professional Football League outfit Rangers have signed 13 new players ahead of the 2022/23 Nigeria Professional Football League season.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"W1\"]},{\"statement\":\"The Enugu-based club finished in fifth position on the log.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"W1\"]},{\"statement\":\"A number of experienced players including captain Tope Olusesi and Ghanaian goalkeeper Seidu Mutawakilu left the Coal City at the end of last season.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"W1\"]}]}","reasoning_content":"We need answer JSON only. Need formulate zero to three minimal factual claims from supplied full evidence and visible source metadata. Only express commitments explicitly supported. Preserve subjects, relations, scope, attribution, conditions, modality. Select observed window references supporting each whole statement. Empty allowed. Need return schema.\n\nWe have one evidence D1 with text. Need produce findings array max 3. Each finding statement and evidence_refs. Evidence refs likely window_ref \"W1\"? Schema says evidence_refs items string. Could use \"W1\" or maybe doc_ref? They say select observed window references supporting each whole statement. Source metadata includes window_ref W1. So use W1.\n\nNeed formulate minimal factual claims. Need be careful. Evidence text:\n\ntitle: NPFL: Rangers Sign 13 New Players Ahead Of New Season\nauthor: Affa Acho\ndate: 2025-06-15\n---\nNigeria Professional Football League outfit Rangers have signed 13 new players ahead of the 2022/23 Nigeria Professional Football League season.\n\nThe Flying Antelopes are overhauling their squad after missing out on continental ticket last season.\n\nThe Enugu- based club finished in fifth position on the log.\n\nA number of experienced players including captain, Tope Olusesi and relia